# dispscan — Charybdis remote status display shield.
#
# Keyless BLE-observer device: Seeed XIAO nRF52840 + nice!view. This file only
# defines the shield symbol; everything else keys off it (Kconfig.defconfig)
# or off the shield name (overlay / conf / keymap discovery).
#
# THE NAME HAS NO UNDERSCORE ON PURPOSE. ZMK's post_boards_shields.cmake treats
# every underscore-trimmed prefix of a shield name as an additional candidate
# for overlay/conf/keymap lookup, so `charybdis_scanner` would also match
# `charybdis` and drag config/charybdis.{conf,keymap} — the KEYBOARD's files —
# into this build. `dispscan` produces no prefixes at all. See the long note at
# the top of dispscan.conf before renaming anything here.

config SHIELD_DISPSCAN
	def_bool $(shields_list_contains,dispscan)
